From c58077ab2f0beaefd8d6b2c9bab2b31ca292ee9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GariTrip Dev <dev@garitrip.local>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 08:57:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add With-Driver stage 2: Drivers tab + driver assignment in
 booking details

- New Drivers tab in AdminPanel.jsx: list/add/edit/delete drivers, following
  the same modal + table conventions as Outlets/Users
- Vehicle create/edit form and card now expose variant/year/registrationPlate
  (added to the schema in stage 1, previously write-only via API)
- BookingDetailsModal: for With-Driver bookings, shows the currently assigned
  driver and (for staff, on non-final bookings) an available-drivers dropdown
  + Assign/Reassign button wired to PUT /bookings/:id/assign-driver
- driverController.getDrivers: added excludeBookingId passthrough so the
  available-drivers dropdown doesn't exclude a driver from their own
  already-assigned booking when reassigning
---
 Backend/controllers/driverController.js |   7 +-
 Frontend/src/pages/AdminPanel.jsx       | 316 +++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 312 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

